// Rule engine — safe, sandboxed evaluator (NO eval / new Function)
//
// Supports a simple expression grammar:
//   <field> <op> <literal>
//   <field>  : dot-path into the context object  (e.g. "amount", "user.role")
//   <op>     : one of  >  >=  <  <=  ==  !=
//   <literal>: a JSON number, a double-quoted string, true, false, or null
